Interchange AssessmentRegistration
    documentation
"This interchange defines the registration of students for assessments. It encompasses information related to the assessment administration, parties that are assigned to administer or participate to the assessment, parts of the assessment for composite scores, and special accommodation students will require."
    domain entity AssessmentAdministration
    domain entity AssessmentAdministrationParticipation
    domain entity StudentAssessmentRegistration
    domain entity AssessmentBatteryPart
    domain entity StudentEducationOrganizationAssessmentAccommodation
    association StudentAssessmentRegistrationBatteryPartAssociation
    